# ECHO PROTOCOL — Unity & Agent Rules

## Project paths
- Workspace root: `d:\Bin\KLTN`
- Unity client: `d:\Bin\KLTN\KLTN` (EchoProtocol.Client)
- Backend: `d:\Bin\KLTN\EchoProtocol.Backend`
- Unity version: 6000.3.19f1 (Unity 6.3 LTS)
- Render pipeline: URP

## MCP Unity (bắt buộc cho Editor ops)
- Dùng `unity-editor` MCP cho scene, GameObject, Component, Prefab
- Unity Editor phải mở và **không** ở Play mode
- Nếu MCP lỗi: kiểm tra Console `[MCP] Server started on port 6400`

## Manual reminder — dừng và nhắc user khi:
- Unity Editor chưa mở hoặc đang Play mode
- Photon Fusion chưa import / chưa có App ID
- Docker Desktop chưa chạy
- Cần secret production thật hoặc deploy cloud

## C# conventions
- `PascalCase` types/methods; `_camelCase` private fields; `camelCase` locals
- One responsibility per MonoBehaviour; `[SerializeField]` over public fields
- Input System for player input; no legacy Input API

## Shell
- Prefix commands with `rtk` when possible

## Architecture reference
- `gamecodex` MCP for game patterns
- `codegraph` before refactors
- `context7` for package/API docs

## Security
- Never commit secrets, JWT keys, DB passwords, Photon App ID in source
- Use `appsettings.Development.json` placeholders only for local dev
